      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Frequently asked questions"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "faq_item",
      "name": "FAQ Item",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "question",
          "label": "Question",
          "default": "What is a serving size?"
        },
        {
          "type": "richtext",
          "id": "answer",
          "label": "Answer",
          "default": "<p>For our cacao we have found 20 g as a base dosage is great start, however here's a guide to finding what's right for you</p><p>~ 11g A micro-chocolatey dose with mild flavor and not too much strength.</p><p>~ 22g A great dose for daily ritual, rich in flavor, not overwhelmingly strong </p><p>~ 33g A strong dose, packed with all of the benefits of cacao, you will definitely be feeling A LOT!</p><p>~ 44g We call this \"Shamanic\" Only for the serious cacao journeyers. Anymore will cause headaches </p>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
